  "cited_article_id": "generate-and-submit-claims",
  "reply": "Please open the **Validation Queue** tab in Claim Center and review the flagged claims. Correct any highlighted errors (missing modifiers, invalid subscriber IDs, unmapped diagnosis codes) and click **Save & Re‑validate**. Ensure the claims are within 90 days of service and that you are not exceeding the 500‑claim batch limit. If the validation error persists even after correcting the data, go to **Billing > Payer Rules** to confirm the payer’s current electronic format requirements, and then check the **Clearinghouse Log** under **Reports** for any rejection codes that may indicate the cause."
}
